<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-mint/25">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mb-8">About Manaaki Midwives</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-ink/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Manaaki Midwives is a group of 4 Lead Maternity Carer (LMC) midwives based in Hutt Central,
          supporting whānau across Upper and Lower Hutt and Wainuiomata.
        </p>
        <p>
          <em>Manaaki</em>, to care for, support and uplift, is at the heart of how we work.
          We believe pregnancy and birth are normal life events that deserve respect, and we walk
          alongside you with clear information and steady support so you can make the choices that
          are right for you and your pēpē.
        </p>
        <p>
          We provide care throughout your pregnancy, labour and birth, and the postnatal weeks at home.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Team photo -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
      <img
        src="/images/hero.jpg"
        alt="The Manaaki Midwives team — Shari, Hayley, Gemma and Jade"
        class="w-full h-auto"
        loading="lazy"
        width="1440"
        height="810"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
